<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ImpactFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Effect or consequence caused by a hazard or another impact. Within an Impact Chain model, Impacts relate to adverse (negative) consequences that can be considered as potential materializations of risks."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#confidence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the confidence level of an Impact Chain factor or connection."@en .
