<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#Affects> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'Affects' connection of an Impact Chain model. Indicates a generic relationship where one element is supposed to alter (in intensity or geographic extent) the second one in some way (not necessarily based on a causal link). Links a Vulnerability to a Impact/Risk factor. Example: Lack of land ownership (Vulnerability) affects the disruption of agricultural livelihoods in a flood (Impact)."@en .
