<https://w3id.org/crima-ontology/ich#ExposureFactor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> "No standard reference, see IPCC, UNDRR (https://www.undrr.org/terminology/exposure), Prevention web (https://www.preventionweb.net/understanding-disaster-risk/component-risk/exposure), Charim or Climate Risk Sourcebook (https://reliefweb.int/report/world/climate-risk-sourcebook)."@en .
